{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_bdrk_01AEuEem6Ex2TgTcDCFi5mzg","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-4-7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me make all the edits to doing.md. I'll do them sequentially since they're in the same file.\n\nChange 1: Line 3 - declaration\nOld: `**YOU MUST declare at the start: \"I will use skill:tdd for implementation. I will use skill:super-debugging for any unexpected behavior.\"**`\nNew: `**YOU MUST declare at the start: \"I will use skill:tdd for implementation. I will use skill:debug-skill for any unexpected behavior.\"**`Change 2: Lines 11-12 - skill list\nOld: `- skill:super-debugging（超级调试框架）：{{super_debugging_path}}`\n\n\nNew: `- skill:debug-skill（调试技能）：{{debug_skill_path}}`\n`- skill:sense（系统化思维，供 review debug agent 使用）：{{sense_skill_path}}`\n\nChange 3: Lines 75-80 - DEBUG 铁律\nOld: `**When encountering ANY bug, YOU MUST declare: \"I will use skill:super-debugging.\" No random fixes. No exceptions.**`\n`遇到任何不符合预期的行为时，必须：`\n`1. 声明 \"I will use skill:super-debugging.\"`\n`2. 走`\n\nNew: `**When encountering ANY bug, YOU MUST declare: \"I will use skill:debug-skill.\" No random fixes. No exceptions.**`\n`遇到任何不符合预期的行为时，必须：`\n`1. 声明 \"I will use skill:debug-skill.\"`\n`2. 加载 debug-skill 文件，执行三阶段调试法：源码推理法→增量调试法→科学实验法，每阶段达上限后升级人工`\n\nThe debug protocol is being updated to use a three-phase methodology—source code reasoning, incremental debugging, and scientific experimentation—with escalation to human review after hitting limits at each stage. 我需要在 debug.md 中添加一个结构化的问题记录格式，包括现象、复现步骤、假设分析和验证方法这几个关键部分。 我在查看 doing.md 文件中关于问题记录的部分，特别是第 164-194 行的调试记录格式说明。\n\n这部分定义了当遇到问题时应该如何在 debug.md 中追加详细的问题记录，包括现象、复现步骤、假设分析等结构化的内容。","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9e925afa-2f89-4943-8759-3263cc20358c","uuid":"0de4aaae-62a1-4699-948b-719807a8b60a"}
